Description: NexusOS boot splash (Plymouth)
 Plymouth theme for NexusOS Engineering Edition: the NexusOS mark on the brand
 background with a teal hexagon animation. It uses Plymouth's two-step plugin,
 so disk-encryption password prompts, update progress and messages keep
 working. The dialog images are the spinner theme's (copied at build time so
 they are part of the initrd), and the Inter fonts are added to the initrd for
 prompts.
 .
 The theme is registered as the default.plymouth alternative with a higher
 priority than Ubuntu's themes; removing the package restores them.
